{"version":1,"key":"card:148","content":{"id":148,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在复杂的网页应用中，DOM 结构会频繁的发生变化，有的时候我们需要根据变化来进行相应的操作，以往通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Mutation Events","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来监听 DOM 的变化，目前它已经废弃了，被 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"MutationObserver","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 所取代。"},{"type":"formatted","text":"MutationObserver","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的兼容性很好，可以放心大胆的使用。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"MutationObserver","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的基本用法如下"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const observer = new MutationObserver(mutations => {\n\n});\nobserver.observe(element, options);","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"dc7acd5e-7f39-4a6c-84b2-7f1a0a65756d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"new MutationObserver()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"MutationObserver","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，构造函数接收一个回调函数作为参数，当被监听的元素 DOM 发生变化时，该回调函数将会执行。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"回调函数接收一个参数，该参数是一个数组，其中元素类型为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"MutationRecord","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"MutationRecord","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 包含如下属性："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"{\n\ttype: 'attributes',\n\ttarget: div#container,\n\taddedNodes: [],\n\tremoveNodes: [],\n\tpreviousSibling: null,\n\tnextSibling: null,\n\tattributeName: '',\n\tattributeNamespace: null,\n\toldValue: ''\n}","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"86975705-43ea-491b-8597-6dfd1760920e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"observe(element, options)","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对元素 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"element","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行监听，除了需要传入要监听的元素以外，还需要传递一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"options","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，它包括如下字段："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"{\n\tchildList: true,\n\tattributes: true,\n\tattributeFilter: ['class', 'style'],\n\tattributeOldValue: true,\n\tcharacterData: true,\n\tcharacterDataOldValue: true,\n\tsubtree: true\n}","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"09e5e397-b463-43a4-8974-30c7a1fa007f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里为了完整性将可设置的所有参数列了出来，实际在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"options","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 参数并不需要指定每一个属性。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以观察到除了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"attributeFilter","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性外，其它属性都是布尔值，也就说这些属性相当于一个开关，设置某个属性为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"true","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就相当于开启某个特性，后面会详细介绍每个属性的作用。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然不需要指定每一个属性，但是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"childList","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","text":"attributes","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","text":"characterData","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这三个属性必须有一个设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"true","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果不再需要监听 DOM 的变化时，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"observer.disconnect()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法停止监听。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"举个🌰："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"<div id=\"container\">\n  <p>世界这么大，我想去看看</p>\n</div>\n<button id=\"btn\">删除元素</button>","language":"html","uuid":"1a21a850-cf49-4701-98bf-828106b1ba20","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const observer = new MutationObserver(mutations => {\n  console.log(mutations);\n});\nobserver.observe(document.getElementById('container'), {\n  childList: true\n});\n\nconst btn = document.getElementById('btn');\nbtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  document.getElementById('container').removeChild(\n    document.querySelector('#container p')\n  );\n});","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"4e9cf2ae-cf10-448d-96e9-d07bd7a8a9e8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"页面中有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"id","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"container","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的元素，其中有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签， "},{"type":"formatted","text":"p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签中其中包含一些文字。页面中还有一个按钮，当点击按钮时，会将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签从 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"container","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中移除。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在我们创建一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"MutationObserver","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，并监听了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"container","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 元素，设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"options","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"childList","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"true","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示当 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"container","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的子节点发生变化时（新增或删除），将会被监听到，从而触发回调函数的执行。在回调函数中，我们只是简单的打印了回调函数的参数。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"ty